notes:
Diagnostic/return-code source occurrence is represented by catalog/fixed/dynamic rows. Arguments: catalogText(catalog, paths ? CatalogMessageId.catalogTokenMissingWithSaved : CatalogMessageId.catalogTokenMissing, {
			name,
		}); "auth_required"

Diagnostic/return-code source occurrence is represented by catalog/fixed/dynamic rows. Arguments: catalogText(catalog, SOURCE_MESSAGE_ID.noCatalogFound, {
			attempts: attempts.map((attempt) => `${attempt.url}: ${attempt.result}`).join("; "),
		})
